WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.977
Sky gatherers

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.480
The Minang people live on the shores of Lake Maninjao.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.890
The Minang women work the rice paddies.
The men tend the coconut trees.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:49.900
In Minang country, the coconut is
the main resource, with 3 million trees.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.210
The men of the Coteaux clan
live off the riches of this forest.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.613
They are the harvesters.

00:00:55.827 --> 00:00:58.270
But they haven't climbed trees for a long time.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.330
They found an ideal partner in nature:
the monkey.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.070
Bourane had monkeys all his life.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.880
In the Koto clan,
he is considered a master.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:21.057
But today Bourane is retired,
there are no more monkeys.

00:01:21.057 --> 00:01:23.050
He advises young trainers.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:28.720
Bourane is old and tired.
Too tired to live with a monkey.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.073
At least, that's what he believed.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:53.290
Rayna is Bourane's wife.
And today, she receives an inheritance from an old aunt.

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:56.470
Jewelry, some furniture, and a monkey.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:04.060
Among the Minang people, everything belongs to the women.
The house, the land, everything!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:32.860
For Bourane, the interesting part of the inheritance
is a macaque monkey.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.010
She is two and a half years old.
Her name is Bobo.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:59.270
Bourane quickly learned to recognize the animal's qualities.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:03.607
Its fur is dense.
Bobo can withstand ant attacks.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:07.520
His cowlick is perfectly centered at the top of his head.
It's a sign of willpower.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:10.910
The shape of his muscles suggests great endurance.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.750
Bourane and Rayna had eight children.
They are grown now.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:44.330
They've all gone to the city
but without them, the house is quiet.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:50.240
Every breeder has their own method.
Bourane always wanted his monkeys to participate.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.760
to family life.
He receives them at his table.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:54.767
and gives them a niche in the house.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:34.250
Bobo is scared; he doesn't know this house.
Bourane has already lived there with about twenty monkeys.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.790
He knows that he needs to show them affection
to capture their attention.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.043
This is his way of making himself heard.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:50.240
Since her children left home,
Rayna has wanted a quiet life.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.047
His rice paddies give him plenty of work.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:10.040
Rayna thought it through carefully.
She needs a buffalo to help her in her rice paddies.

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:14.150
Bobo will be sold.
With the money, she will buy a buffalo.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:35.390
Among the Minang people, women make the decisions.
Among the Minang, it's official.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:56.740
Bourane's wife asked him to test
Bobo to determine its value.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:00.610
Here, a well-trained monkey is worth the price of a buffalo.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:44.120
Bobo can't do anything.
She doesn't understand orders.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.980
She can't manage to pick the coconuts.

00:07:01.043 --> 00:07:06.400
A large gathering competition takes place every year.
The young trainers prepare their monkeys.

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.080
It takes place in two weeks.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:12.760
Usually, Bourane always wins it.
But this year, the youngsters are reassured.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:15.117
Bobo isn't going to worry them.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:29.400
Bobo is absolutely worthless.
Rayna won't get a penny out of him.

00:07:29.493 --> 00:07:31.764
And for her, this is very bad news.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:07.500
Like all monkeys, Bobo is possessive,
jealous, and she wants to be the center of attention.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:12.190
family attention.
But Rayna doesn't want to get attached to Bobo.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:35.530
Rayna asked her husband to make Bobo
a good picker.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:39.030
The old master starts the training of Bobo from scratch.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:43.340
Bourane says it takes several months
to train a monkey.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.050
But Bobo is very talented.
She understood everything in just a few days.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.220
He just needs a little more training.

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:36.400
When the day is over,
Bourane chooses a ripe walnut for Bobo.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:40.200
But with a monkey, learning through reward is not enough.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.060
The monkey needs to feel protected and pampered.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.093
Bourane has become indispensable.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.150
Bobo would like to see her all to herself,
all the time.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.040
Copra is the flesh of the coconut.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.070
It is ground, pressed and cooked for hours.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.710
Oil is extracted from it
and sold at the market.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:28.340
Milk is used as an ingredient in cooking
and as food for babies.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:35.450
Rayna will go sell the produce
from the first Bobo harvests.

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:15.540
Every morning, Bourane practices his Silat.
He pays homage to his land.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:24.830
Lake Maninjao has formed its bed
in the craters of three volcanoes.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.130
Its shores and islands belong to the clan of Buran,
the Kotos.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:34.370
The nut pickers are always on the move.
They go from one person's house to another's, as needed.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.550
Out of ten nuts picked by Bobo, Bourane takes one for himself.

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.690
The other nine belong to the owner of the tree.

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.507
For bobo, foraging holds no more secrets.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:13.530
Soon, she will make it rain from the sky
500 to 1000 nuts a day, like her elders.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:40.240
Buran has a secret garden.
Somewhere on the foothills of the crater

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.560
A torrent of hot water flows.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:47.440
The old man is greeted by the guardians of the place,
the Siamangs, the howler gibbons.

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.090
A fleeting miracle.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:19.970
The Rafflesia, the largest flower in the world.
It only lives for three days.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:27.317
For three days, hundreds of bees will come to forage on his hectare

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:29.187
and lose oneself in its petals.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:33.020
Because the Rafflesia is carnivorous.
Its nectar is poisonous.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.830
After a long day of gathering,
the monkey's muscles are tense.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:02.640
Bobo is still developing.
She won't be fully grown until she's three years old.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.040
Bourane is keeping a close eye on its growth.

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:22.410
Bobo accepted his new father
and Bourane rediscovered his passion for the profession.

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:25.420
However, we will have to part ways.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:51.070
In Balimbing, they brought out the Minang colors:
yellow for nobility, red for cheerfulness,

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:52.510
black for bravery.

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.210
The day of the big competition has arrived.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.390
Now is the time for Bobo to prove himself
in the eyes of the clan.

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:15.260
Bourane wants her to win.
He's been motivating her for a week.

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.760
His reputation is at stake.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:22.610
For Rayna, this competition will primarily
determine the value of her monkey.

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:49.330
Bobo managed to pick 7 nuts in 2 minutes.

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:09.790
Born in Assyria.

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:13.810
Sahar is a wealthy merchant.
He was the one who refereed the competition.

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.593
And now he wants to hurt himself.

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:43.983
The negotiations are secret;
no one is to know the amount.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:06.250
Bourane doesn't have the heart to part with Bobo.
But among the Minangs,

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.110
Nothing is decided without the agreement of women.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.650
Women preserve the heritage.
Neither the house nor the land,

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:37.210
Neither the jewelry nor the jewelry can be sold.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:40.390
Now Rayna will be able to buy her buffalo.

00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:35.160
The market takes place in Lumbu Bassum every Saturday.
That's where copra is sold and

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:36.587
that we buy the animals.

00:23:29.877 --> 00:23:33.440
Rayna thought it through carefully.
Even though she struggles in the rice paddies,

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:37.260
Even though a buffalo would have been a great relief,
she decided to buy Bobo back.

00:24:15.230 --> 00:24:18.710
Bourane and Bobo are going to pick some more coconuts together.

00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:22.697
Rayna will wait for another opportunity
to get her buffalo.

00:24:23.210 --> 00:24:26.347
After all, Bobo provides them with what they need to live.

00:24:26.720 --> 00:24:30.110
And besides, we mustn't separate
the sky gatherers.

